    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d469">

                <pb facs="0509" n="475" xml:id="pg475"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barrett to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-05-12T12:10:00+06:42"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                                1897—12.10 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Hannen telegraphs will act arbitrator if British minister for foreign affairs
                    approves. I would advise you to communicate with the British minister for
                    foreign affairs as soon as possible. Siamese Government doing it.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Barrett.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
